  "body": "I was getting really annoyed trying to replicate destructuring semantics in ES5, so I just switched. Plus class syntax and arrow functions and shorthand methods... delicious.\n\nAlso fixed a number of minor conformance issues along the way, and did a pass through the tests to make them have similar styles and updated variable names.\n\n/cc @arv @johnjbarton for Traceur usage review (check out run-tests.js, mostly).\n\n/cc @othiym23 since much of this was originally his work.\n",
